---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title={`About — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="What The Economics of AI is, and what it isn't." />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        background: #0A0F1E;
        color: #F0EDE6;
        font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }
      nav {
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 18px 40px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(240,237,230,0.08);
        position: sticky; top: 0; background: #0A0F1E; z-index: 100;
      }
      .nav-logo { display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-decoration: none; }
      .nav-logo-main { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 18px; color: #F0EDE6; line-height: 1; }
      .nav-logo-sub { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; color: #F5A623; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 3px; }
      .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 28px; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      .nav-links a { color: rgba(240,237,230,0.5); text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; }
      .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a.active { color: #F0EDE6; }
      .nav-links a.active { color: #F5A623; }
      .nav-subscribe { background: #F5A623; color: #0A0F1E; border: none; padding: 9px 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 3px; text-decoration: none; }

      .about-wrap { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 40px 100px; }
      .about-eyebrow { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #F5A623; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 22px; }
      .about-headline { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 50px); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #F0EDE6; margin-bottom: 36px; }
      .about-headline em { font-style: italic; color: #F5A623; }
      .about-text { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgba(240,237,230,0.7); margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .about-text strong { color: #F0EDE6; }

      .pillars { margin: 48px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px; background: rgba(240,237,230,0.07); border: 1px solid rgba(240,237,230,0.07); }
      .pillar { background: #0A0F1E; padding: 22px 26px; display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 18px; }
      .pillar-num { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(240,237,230,0.28); flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; }
      .pillar-name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #F0EDE6; }
      .pillar-desc { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(240,237,230,0.45); margin-top: 4px; }

      .about-pills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 36px 0; }
      .pill { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: rgba(240,237,230,0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(240,237,230,0.12); padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 20px; }

      .about-cta { margin-top: 56px; padding-top: 36px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(240,237,230,0.08); }
      .btn-primary { background: #F5A623; color: #0A0F1E; border: none; padding: 14px 28px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 3px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; }

      footer.site-footer { border-top: 1px solid rgba(240,237,230,0.07); padding: 36px 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .footer-logo { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgba(240,237,230,0.45); }
      .footer-copy { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: rgba(240,237,230,0.18); }
      .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 22px; }
      .footer-links a { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(240,237,230,0.28); text-decoration: none; }
      .footer-links a:hover { color: rgba(240,237,230,0.65); }

      @media (max-width: 700px) {
        nav { padding: 16px 20px; }
        .nav-links { display: none; }
        .about-wrap { padding: 48px 20px 60px; }
        footer.site-footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; text-align: center; padding: 28px 20px; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav>
      <a class="nav-logo" href="/">
        <span class="nav-logo-main">The Economics of AI</span>
        <span class="nav-logo-sub">Follow the money</span>
      </a>
      <ul class="nav-links">
        <li><a href="/">Analysis</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog">Archive</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about" class="active">About</a></li>
      </ul>
      <a class="nav-subscribe" href="/#subscribe">Subscribe Free</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="about-wrap">
      <p class="about-eyebrow">About this publication</p>
      <h1 class="about-headline">Not news.<br />Not hype.<br /><em>Just the economics.</em></h1>

      <p class="about-text">Most AI coverage focuses on model capabilities, product launches, and what happened last week. <strong>The Economics of AI</strong> goes one level deeper — into the capital flows, business models, and structural dynamics that actually determine who wins and who loses as this industry matures.</p>

      <p class="about-text">Every piece is grounded in earnings data, capex disclosures, and public filings — not press releases or hype cycles. No stock tips, no affiliate links, no sponsored placements.</p>

      <div class="pillars">
        <div class="pillar">
          <span class="pillar-num">01</span>
          <div>
            <div class="pillar-name">Capital Spending</div>
            <div class="pillar-desc">Where hyperscalers deploy hundreds of billions, and what it means economically</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <span class="pillar-num">02</span>
          <div>
            <div class="pillar-name">Business Models</div>
            <div class="pillar-desc">Revenue mechanics, margin structure, and why well-funded startups still go bankrupt</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <span class="pillar-num">03</span>
          <div>
            <div class="pillar-name">Winners &amp; Losers</div>
            <div class="pillar-desc">Durable competitive advantages as model costs collapse and performance converges</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <span class="pillar-num">04</span>
          <div>
            <div class="pillar-name">Supply Chain</div>
            <div class="pillar-desc">Chips, cooling systems, power infrastructure, networking, and data center REITs</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <span class="pillar-num">05</span>
          <div>
            <div class="pillar-name">Productivity Economy</div>
            <div class="pillar-desc">How AI efficiency gains show up in GDP data, corporate earnings, and labor markets</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-pills">
        <span class="pill">Earnings-grounded</span>
        <span class="pill">No stock tips</span>
        <span class="pill">No affiliate links</span>
        <span class="pill">Independent</span>
        <span class="pill">Long-form</span>
      </div>

      <div class="about-cta">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="/blog">Browse all essays</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="footer-logo">The Economics of AI</div>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/blog">Archive</a>
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-copy">Independent analysis · Est. 2025</div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>